[51.422503, "o", "<returncode>\r\n0\r\n<output>\r\nk 19\r\nmissing next ACTGACCGGAACAGCGTTT A CTGACCGGAACAGCGTTTA\r\nbad 1 nexts 9994\r\nstarts 6\r\ncontig len 3598 ATAGCCAGTGCCTGATACTGGCTGGAGAAGAGATAATGAGGCTTAACGCC GAATGTGTCACATATGACCA\r\ncontig len 1467 AGCCATTAACGATTGTCCGGGGCTCACTGTTTCGCCGACCTGAACACTTC AACAATATCATTGCGGCTAT\r\ncontig len 846 ATCCCATTTATCGTATGGAGATAAAGGGGCGATAGTGGTTGTATTTTCAG CAGAGCCTTCTCCCAAACCA\r\ncontig len 380 CGATAAACGGCGTCACGTTGATATCATGCATTTCGCCGTTATCGTCGAGG TGCCCCAGACCGTACCAAAC\r\ncontig len 3590 AGCCACAACGTGCTGCTGGCAAGCGATGTTGAACAGTTCGCGAAAAAGAA ACAACAACCATTACCACCAG\r\nvoid\r\ncontig len 227 AGCCTTTATCACTGAGGCTATAGAAACTGCGTCGCCCGATGCGGGAAACA CACTGACCGGAACAGCGTTT\r\nuncovered 6\r\nout max 1 in max 1\r\nnodes with out0 5\r\nnodes with in0 6\r\n\r\n"]
