[217.12858, "o", "<returncode>\r\n0\r\n<output>\r\n/tmp/berkeley_upc-2022.10.0/docs/html/system/upcr.ps:3388:(    - upc_lock_init\\(\\) is no longer necessary or useful and is removed) s\r\n/tmp/berkeley_upc-2022.10.0/docs/html/system/upcr.txt:1548:    - upc_lock_init() is no longer necessary or useful and is removed\r\n/tmp/berkeley_upc-2022.10.0/upcr_locks.h:25: *   - upc_lock_init() is no longer necessary or useful and is removed\r\n/tmp/berkeley_upc-2022.10.0/upc-tests/mupc/test_locks2.c:6:     Function tested: upc_global_lock_alloc, upc_lock_init, upc_lock, upc_unlock\r\n/tmp/berkeley_upc-2022.10.0/upc-tests/mupc/test_locks2.c:9:     - Tests the correctness of upc_global_alloc. Also test if upc_lock_init, upc_lock,\r\n/tmp/berkeley_upc-2022.10.0/upc-tests/mupc/test_locks2.c:61:            upc_lock_init(lock_1);\r\n/tmp/berkeley_upc-2022.10.0/upc-tests/mupc/test_locks2.c:62:            upc_lock_init(lock_2);\r\n/tmp/berkeley_upc-2022.10.0/upc-tests/mupc/test_locks1.c:6:     Function tested: upc_all_lock_alloc, upc_lock_init, upc_lock, upc_unlock\r\n/tmp/berkeley_upc-2022.10.0/upc-tests/mupc/test_locks1.c:34:                using upc_lock_init.\r\n/tmp/berkeley_upc-2022.10.0/upc-tests/mupc/test_locks1.c:55:    upc_lock_init(lock1); /* Initialize lock */ \r\n/tmp/berkeley_upc-2022.10.0/upc-tests/mupc/test_locks4.c:6:     Function tested: upc_global_lock_alloc, upc_lock_init, upc_lock, upc_unlock\r\n/tmp/berkeley_upc-2022.10.0/upc-tests/mupc/test_locks4.c:67:            upc_lock_init(lock_1);\r\n/tmp/berkeley_upc-2022.10.0/upc-tests/mupc/BugList:95:   the lock using upc_lock_init(). This does not conform to the UPC specifcation as locks are supposed to \r\nbe \r\n/tmp/berkeley_upc-2022.10.0/upc-tests/mupc/BugList:97:   upc_lock_init() will be made obsolete in the next revision of the UPC specification. \r\n/tmp/berkeley_upc-2022.10.0/upc-tests/mupc/test_locks3.c:6:     Function tested: upc_all_lock_alloc, upc_lock_init, upc_lock_attempt, upc_unlock\r\n/tmp/berkeley_upc-2022.10.0/upc-tests/mupc/test_locks3.c:55:    upc_lock_init(lock_1);\r\n/tmp/berkeley_upc-2022.10.0/upc-tests/mupc/test_int_multilocks.c:6:        Function tested: upc_all_alloc, upc_memset, up_all_lock_alloc, upc_lock_init, \r\nupc_lock, upc_unlock\r\n/tmp/berkeley_upc-2022.10.0/upc-tests/mupc/test_int_multilocks.c:32:    [10/3/2002] Bug reported to programmer. Problem might lie with upc_lock_init and \r\n/tmp/berkeley_upc-2022.10.0/upc-tests/mupc/test_int_multilocks.c:65:    upc_lock_init(lock_1);\r\n/tmp/berkeley_upc-2022.10.0/upc-tests/mupc/test_int_multilocks.c:66:    upc_lock_init(lock_2);\r\n\r\n"]
