[262.288891, "o", "<returncode>\r\n0\r\n<output>\r\n26: *   - upc_lock_free() is added to allow users to free dynamically-allocated locks\r\n31: *   - upc_all_lock_free() is added\r\n175:UPCRI_DEPRECATED_STUB(bupc_all_lock_free)\r\n176:#define bupc_all_lock_free(lockptr) (bupc_all_lock_free (), upcr_all_lock_free(lockptr))\r\n/tmp/berkeley_upc-2022.10.0/upcr.h:498:  #define upc_all_lock_alloc      upcr_all_lock_alloc\r\n\r\n"]
