[302.618442, "o", "\r\u001b[2K\r\n\u001b[1;31mmini-swe-agent\u001b[0m\u001b[31m (step \u001b[0m\u001b[1;31m34\u001b[0m\u001b[31m, \u001b[0m\u001b[1;31m$0.00\u001b[0m\u001b[31m):\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[32m⠋\u001b[0m Waiting for the LM to respond...\r\u001b[2K```\r\nsed -n '130,250p' /usr/local/bin/upcc_multi.pl; echo '--- 340-380'; sed -n '340,380p' /usr/local/bin/upcc_multi.pl\r\n```\r\n\u001b[32m⠋\u001b[0m Waiting for the LM to respond..."]
