[426.800072, "o", "\r\u001b[2KImplemented and verified the UPC-based parallel de Bruijn graph assembler.\r\n\r\nWhat was completed:\r\n- Added `/app/serial.c` implementing serial hash-table construction and contig traversal.\r\n- Added `/app/pgen.upc` implementing parallel UPC construction with striped bucket locks and parallel path traversal.\r\n- Installed and configured Berkeley UPC 2022.10.0 in SMP mode.\r\n- Added `/app/Makefile` building `serial` and `pgen`.\r\n- Generated `/app/serial.out` and `/app/pgen_0.out` through `/app/pgen_3.out` using 4 UPC threads.\r\n- Verified all 6 contigs match between serial and parallel outputs after ordering-independent comparison.\r\n\r\n```\r\necho COMPLETE_TASK_AND_SUBMIT_FINAL_OUTPUT\r\n```\r\n\u001b[32m⠹\u001b[0m Waiting for the LM to respond..."]
